| Testing Type | Core Question It Answers |
| --- | --- |
| *Unit* | Does this individual function or line of code work correctly? |
| *Integration* | Do these two separate modules talk to each other without errors? |
| *System* | Does the entire application work together from a user's perspective? |
| *Smoke* | Is the application stable enough for us to even bother testing it? |
| *Sanity* | Did the developer actually fix the specific bug they claimed to fix? |
| *Regression* | Did the new code changes or bug fixes accidentally break old, working features? |


